ag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on towering bosses equipped with formidable defenses and devastating attack patterns. Victory demands strategy, precision, and clever use of your full weapon arsenal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2-Player Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with a friend in local co-op mode. Coordinate your firepower, support each other in heated battles, and tackle the toughest encounters as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modern Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <i>Project X: Light Years</i> with modern enhancements including high-definition graphics, achievements, and online leaderboards. Compete globally for the highest scores, fastest runs, and ultimate bragging rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brimble Brothers Are Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alister and Chris Brimble reunite with the franchise, restoring the unmistakable legacy of the original classic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced Continue System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your allocated credits to continue from place you died. Quit and save your session to resume later, or restart from any level you’ve already beaten. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Casual Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play on Rookie difficulty with <strong>99 credits</strong>. Sit back, relax, and enjoy a stress-free gaming experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tiny Wings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Special difficulty - Fewer waves, zero bosses, the game is 30% shorter, and it's really hard to go down. Just fly and pew-pew</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080530/extras/2ca839d4f58ef7c8f5bb51305ca1b7a6.poster.avif?t=1788873104\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080530/extras/2ca839d4f58ef7c8f5bb51305ca1b7a6.webm?t=1788873104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080530/extras/2ca839d4f58ef7c8f5bb51305ca1b7a6.mp4?t=1788873104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Definition Visuals: Stunning, hand-crafted visuals bring the universe of &quot;Project X Light Years&quot; to life, with vibrant colors and detailed environments.                       </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated 2 Soundtracks: Choose between an epic soundtrack that captures the spirit of the original game, or an alternative version with a harder, more intense beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth Controls: Intuitive and responsive controls designed for both veteran players and newcomers. No inertia this time :)<br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability: Online Seasons, Arena and Main Story,  5 game modes, 5 difficulty levels, hidden secrets, and unlockable content ensure hours of engaging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Player Co-Op Mode.   <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080530/extras/dd077de2b81d94eb933b0145d728a45f.poster.avif?t=1788873104\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080530/extras/dd077de2b81d94eb933b0145d728a45f.webm?t=1788873104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080530/extras/dd077de2b81d94eb933b0145d72