        "short_description": "The official Project X sequel ✨ Back after 30 years!🎮 A demanding, skill-based experience that rewards patience and mastery. Not every game is for everyone — this one is for players who love a real, fair challenge. Try the demo and see if you’re up for it. Failure teaches. Mastery rewards.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
